 Usage: darwin-shared-symbol NAME [PATH-FILTER]"),
 	   &cmdlist);
 
+  add_cmd ("darwin-shared-unwind-scan", class_info,
+	   darwin_shared_unwind_scan_command,
+	   _("Scan compact unwind modes of loaded cache images."),
